# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, City & Guild — Introduction (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** City & Guild (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Introduction (pp. 5–6)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The Introduction’s narrative, verbatim: what the book covers, and how the Hermetic Order
> sits inside the mundane fabric of Mythic Europe — Tribunal rulings, interference with the
> mundanes, and why shunning all contact is impractical for most covenants. The chapter’s one
> Text Box, the Bibliography, is GUIDANCE in `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-introduction-sidebars.ttrpg`.

